# Repo-wide whitespace rules for `git diff --check`.
#
# Default Git whitespace rules are kept (real trailing space, space-before-tab,
# blank-at-eof). `cr-at-eol` is added so the CR in this Windows-checked-in
# codebase's CRLF line endings is NOT treated as trailing whitespace on added
# lines -- it is the line-ending convention, not a defect.
#
# Net effect:
#   * Real trailing spaces      -> still flagged (blank-at-eol).
#   * Real space-before-tab     -> still flagged (space-before-tab).
#   * Trailing blank lines      -> still flagged (blank-at-eof).
#   * CR at end of CRLF lines   -> NOT flagged (cr-at-eol).
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,space-before-tab,blank-at-eof,cr-at-eol
